s":"Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants, Vegetarian","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"vN6v8m4DO45Z4pp8yxxF_w","review_id":"XBspSfNaZeo5INBgJpjSdw","date":"2015-09-20T02:56:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9521248936653137,"text_excerpt":"Went here for breakfast this morning. While on my trip through the south I needed to try shrimp and grits since I have never had it before, and when I told my mom they had bananas foster french toast, well this was the place to go. It opens at 8 am I think and we got there about 9 and easily got right in, half way through eating we noticed a line forming outside, so we picked the right time. Oh yeah there was plenty of parking around on the side streets. All the people that worked there were really nice, there is something to the whole Southern hospitality thing isn't there. Tom was our server and he was really nice and helpful. The shrimp and grits was amazing, the grits tasted a little ..."},{"business_id":"vN6v8m4DO45Z4pp8yxxF_w","review_id":"oibCz49kXAP8goFOGEUmwQ","date":"2014-02-07T04:47:54","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9449776411056519,"text_excerpt":"This place is so great. I love the laid back atmosphere. Walked right in with our dog and were seating on the cozy wrap around porch outside. We ate here the last morning of our trip and it was the perfect ending. I stayed full long enough to get me through and 8 hour car ride home! I had the bananas foster French toast which was amazing but super rich. I couldn't eat it all because of the portion size and richness. My fiancé opted for the healthier choice of a vegetable omelet which was delicious as well. I can't wait to come back here and try something else on the menu. I will definitely try one of their famous juices next time."},{"business_id":"vN6v8m4DO45Z4pp8yxxF_w","review_id":"n2B9dBr3rQuLQyicxfjIKw","date":"2010-03-09T01:05:32","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9420474767684937,"text_excerpt":"The grillade and grits (which was a daily special) was awesome. The grits were super creamy, but not heavy. We also tried the creole eggs which tasted wonderful but paled in comparison to how great the grits were. The wait was a bit long (we went on a Saturday around 11:30am), but it was well worth it. We also started eyeing the banana pancakes that our neighbor ordered, but seeing as they were bigger than the plate they were carried out on, we just had to pass. Also, this is one of the few places in the city that I've seen fresh-squeezed juices and vegetarian/vegan options. Its nice to find a place in the South that does not deep fry everything."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"vN6v8m4DO45Z4pp8yxxF_w","photo_id":"8np4W2NUXcGjHLc9DKD_IA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/8np4W2NUXcGjHLc9DKD_IA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8661172389984131},{"business_id":"vN6v8m4DO45Z4pp8yxxF_w","photo_id":"t844_HNnrrXR0hyhJako3w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/t844_HNnrrXR0hyhJako3w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8479039669036865},